WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.247
Step five. Deposit the down payment.

2
00:00:03.247 --> 00:00:11.486
Click Create and deposit. You'll sign twice: once to create the agreement, and once to move your down payment into the vault.

3
00:00:11.486 --> 00:00:18.103
Here is the first signature in Albedo, on testnet. Confirm it, then confirm the second one.

4
00:00:18.103 --> 00:00:23.739
The deposit now sits in the vault, and the simulated yield ticks up every second.

5
00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:29.247
Your dashboard shows the vault balance, what you still owe, and the projected payoff.

